{"slug":"expensya","name":"Expensya","description":"Expensya (part of Medius) is an AI-powered spend and expense management platform that automates receipt capture and expense reporting with OCR, enforces policies and approvals, issues corporate/virtual cards with budgets, and supports multi-currency, multi-country compliance, and legal archiving. It integrates with ERPs, HR/payroll, banks, and travel tools to give finance teams full visibility, stronger compliance, and faster reimbursements, with interactive analytics and mobile apps.","icon":"https://stuff.thingsofbrand.com/expensya.com/images/imgd_expensya.png","domain":"expensya.com","rank":230,"labels":["Finance","Accounting","Payment Processing","Analytics"],"categories":["accounting","payments","analytics"],"eventsRead":true,"events":[{"n":"List Expense Reports","d":"Find expense reports and return submitter, status, date, and total amount; supports search, date-range filters, status or owner filters, sorting, and pagination.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Add Receipt","d":"Create an expense from a receipt (JPEG, PNG, PDF) and extract its details with OCR.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Add Expense","d":"Create an expense (amount, currency, category, merchant, VAT), optionally attach a receipt or file, and submit it for approval.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"List Users","d":"Find users in your Expensya account. Optionally search or filter and view each user's name, email, role, type, and account status.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"List Categories","d":"Search and retrieve expense categories, with options to filter, sort, paginate, or find by name or ID.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Find Projects","d":"Find projects in your Expensya account to select, map, or filter in workflows.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"List Payment Methods","d":"Retrieve payment methods available for expenses and payments, including corporate cards, virtual cards, bank accounts, and wallets.","t":"action","k":"hook"}],"rec